POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workshop-services
Authorization: Bearer {{issueToken.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Metricas - servico A",
  "description": "Servico de teste com peso de 60 minutos",
  "unitPrice": 180.50,
  "estimatedDurationMinutes": 60
}

### Workshop Services 2/6 - Create weighted workshop service B
# @name createWeightedServiceB
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workshop-services
Authorization: Bearer {{issueToken.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Metricas - servico B",
  "description": "Servico de teste com peso de 120 minutos",
  "unitPrice": 280.50,
  "estimatedDurationMinutes": 120
}

